        "title": "Kapu tuang suaihiam tei ganlou",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kapu tuang suaihiam tei ganlou dulana,",
            "Changman na ruan tat kanmei nah kum;",
            "Kandih ramta kamei @&4 phu khuan e,",
            "Kachangmei khou@&4 buithang ruan tat tucho?",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Kaikhou hanguang datro tuna kao e,",
            "Zion jangkhang @&4 nang tan tan jina cho?",
            "Jiprina bammei bumang jip thao tho,",
            "Poubaumei tan tan diu khang,",
            "Nangta kao bam the.",
            "",
            "2. Ruanman tat kanmei nah npou kumma,",
            "Lunggai chingkhiumei ta akhiamma bam e;",
            "Ram khe sumei le ningthiu sumei guai le,",
            "Kachangmei khou@&4 buithang ruan tat tucho?",
            "",
            "3. Poubaumei @&4 kao khou nang gutlou jina cho?",
            "Zion khang @&4 thou tanh tan nina cho?",
            "Nang poubaumei tuang siamruai sujina cho?",
            "Laujiu changmun lanlou bam khou gut datro."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
